- recording: Pass configuration
- simulator
  use std.concurrency to send commands, like selecting an audio interface, etc.
  thread 1 creates thread 2
  thread 2 sends PCM recorders available (Asound obj), sents list to thread 1
  thread 1 asks which interface to use, sends selection to thread 2
- record buffer when something happens
- auto normalize (alsa does this with plughw:)

